Carmen?

331
00:37:26,786 --> 00:37:29,550
Os meus comprimidos.
Carmen.

332
00:37:35,895 --> 00:37:39,194
Carmen. Carmen.
Quem, quem...

333
00:37:39,265 --> 00:37:41,199
